@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "About & privacy"; }
<section class="container portal-container py-5"><div class="teleporter-panel">
    <h1>About this breakfast portal</h1>
    <p>This unofficial fan project picks a random Waffle House from a bundled OpenStreetMap catalog. It is not affiliated with Waffle House.</p>
    <p>No account, ZIP code, or device location is needed. The app does not add analytics or tracking cookies. Hosting servers may keep ordinary request logs.</p>
    <p>Entering Street View or opening a map sends you to Google Maps, which has its own privacy policy. If an embedded viewer is configured, your browser contacts Google when you teleport.</p>
    <p>Location data is © <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap contributors</a>, available under the <a href="https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/">Open Database License (ODbL)</a>. The catalog may not include every restaurant or reflect recent closures.</p>
</div></section>
